# Student Data Management System

A menu-driven Python application developed as part of a computer programming laboratory activity. This project manages structured student records using fundamental Python data types and supports full CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Display) operations.

## Data Structures Used
- **Strings:** Student Number, Name, and Major fields.
- **Tuples:** Immutable contact information `(Mymail, Phone Number)`.
- **Lists:** Dynamic collection of enrolled courses `["CS101", "MATH101"]`.
- **Dictionaries:** Core database mapping `Student Number -> Student Details`.

